# The functions of Mission_SheriffMayor in level townhall (the script levels/townhall/scripts/mission_sheriffmayor.py of data02.packed) that are data: one section
# per function, its parameters after the name. The other functions of the script are C (src/game/Script/levels/Townhall.c): InitStatus, ReadyToTalk, Blablibla, PoliceBossMissionSpeech, OnPay, SetNextMission.
# Made by a converter from the script. A pack in mods/ with scrapc/levels/townhall/mission_sheriffmayor.def replaces this file.
section Init LevelPath
call MissionsFuncs.SetMissionTarget "PoliceBoss_SheriffMayor"
call Mission_SheriffMayor.Blablibla
call Scrap.Set "GenCharStdFar" 1000

section CreateMayor e
object $e
LLogicDefaultState 6
LLogicDefaultTarget ""
LLogicState 6
LLogicTarget ""
LLogicIdle 1
LLogicIdle 0

section CreatePoliceBoss e
object $e
UseFunc "Mission_SheriffMayor.PoliceBossMissionSpeech"
LLogicDefaultState 6
LLogicDefaultTarget ""
LLogicState 6
LLogicTarget ""
LLogicIdle 1
LLogicIdle 0
